<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>lovesucker</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Haiden Henderson</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">tension</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2qmzZP5lgG2DN9DuZfIaPO</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.702" end="00:07.690">I didn't wanna fall in love tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.690" end="00:11.254">I thought we'd make out, maybe grab a bite</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.254" end="00:14.130">She said she likes to keep things cut and dry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.130" end="00:17.227">And at first, so did I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.227" end="00:20.799">She's infecting my mind, taking over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.799" end="00:23.136">Her grip is like a vice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.136" end="00:24.636">Blood is cold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.397" end="00:26.803">She's pretty by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.803" end="00:28.303">Pulls me closer</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.183" end="00:29.990">She sees me as food</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.990" end="00:31.870">I know that I'm screwed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.870" end="00:34.449">My baby is a monster, a hunter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.449" end="00:35.949">But I'm not afraid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.812" end="00:37.312">I let her in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.074" end="00:39.644">Now her lipstick's on my pillowcase</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.644" end="00:43.530">If looks could kill, I'd be dead with a smile on my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.530" end="00:46.316">I'm handing her my heart on a plate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.316" end="00:49.758">My baby is a lovesucker (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.758" end="00:53.644">But she loves me like no other (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.644" end="00:57.302">My baby is a lovesucker (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.302" end="01:02.216">But she loves me like no other (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.216" end="01:05.803">She likes her breakfast naked in her bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.803" end="01:09.391">She dines and dashes while I'm getting dressed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.391" end="01:13.103">I call it serious she calls it sex</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.103" end="01:15.459">When she bothers to call</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.459" end="01:19.077">She's infecting my life, taking over</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.077" end="01:21.433">I want her all the time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.433" end="01:22.933">Never full</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.677" end="01:25.085">It's stronger every night</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.085" end="01:26.585">I need closure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.328" end="01:28.153">She sees me as food</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.153" end="01:29.949">And I want her too</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.949" end="01:32.709">My baby is a monster, a hunter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.709" end="01:34.209">But I'm not afraid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.125" end="01:35.625">I let her in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.267" end="01:37.716">Now her lipstick's on my pillowcase</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.716" end="01:41.411">If looks could kill, I'd be dead with a smile on my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.411" end="01:44.460">I'm handing her my heart on a plate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.460" end="01:48.131">My baby is a lovesucker (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.131" end="01:51.730">But she loves me like no other (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.730" end="01:55.545">My baby is a lovesucker (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.545" end="02:03.545">But she loves me like no other (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.912" end="02:05.648">I need her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.648" end="02:07.528">More than you will ever know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.528" end="02:09.332">Oh I think it's chemical</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.332" end="02:11.203">Oh I think it's chemical</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.203" end="02:13.017">Endless thirst</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.017" end="02:14.682">I feel it in my bones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.682" end="02:16.691">Oh I'd let her take me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.691" end="02:18.315">Oh I'd let her take me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.315" end="02:20.246">I need her</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.246" end="02:22.037">More than you will ever know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.037" end="02:23.939">Oh I think it's chemical</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.939" end="02:25.796">Oh I think it's chemical</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.796" end="02:27.733">Endless thirst</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.733" end="02:29.373">I feel it in my bones</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.373" end="02:31.149">Oh I'd let her take me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.149" end="02:33.461">Oh I'd let her take me home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.461" end="02:36.319">My baby is a monster, a hunter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.319" end="02:37.819">But I'm not afraid</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.775" end="02:39.275">I let her in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.744" end="02:41.309">Now her lipstick's on my pillowcase</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.309" end="02:45.457">If looks could kill, I'd be dead with a smile on my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.457" end="02:48.155">I'm handing her my heart on a plate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.155" end="02:51.774">My baby is a lovesucker (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.774" end="02:55.445">But she loves me like no other (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.445" end="02:59.033">My baby is a lovesucker (Oooo ooo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.033" end="03:03.033">But she loves me like no other (Oooo ooo)</p></div></body></tt>